Name: ovolesti
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-07-15
Author: Vissarion Fisikopoulos <vissarion@users.noreply.github.com>
Maintainer: Vissarion Fisikopoulos <vissarion@users.noreply.github.com>
Title: Octave binding for volesti
Description: High-dimensional sampling and volume computation for convex
 polytopes.  Provides classdef wrappers (HPolytope, VPolytope, Zonotope,
 Spectahedron) around the volesti C++ library, with oct-file bindings for
 uniform sampling and volume estimation.
Depends: octave (>= 9.1)
License: GPLv3+
Url: https://github.com/GeomScale/ovolesti
